(text "ISOLATED NMEA 2000. NOT FOR FABRICATION. No 120 ohm resistor is fitted or even placed.\\nGND_CAN is the ISO1042 side-2 ground and the DC-DC secondary return. It is not connected to GND.\\nNET-S has a connector pin and no PCB net. It is not a power source and not a return.\\nISO1042 datasheet: bus pins are high-impedance when unpowered. The publish jumper defaults open, so VCC2 stays off\\nand this board does not bias or drive the bus. Fit the jumper only after the Waveshare transmitter is removed.\\nTXD has an external pull-up to +3V3 because the datasheet says the internal pull-up is too weak to guarantee recessive." (at 20 250 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "588d97c8-5b30-4e9d-bb68-03723a87bef5"))
