(global_label "GND_CAN" (shape passive) (at 320.04 156.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f3556e5c-bba1-4101-8751-0c8b8b814dba"))
(text "ISO1042BDWR pin numbers are the DW-16 datasheet (VCC1=1, GND1=2, TXD=3, RXD=5, GND1=8, GND2=9,\\nVCC2=10 and 11 and 16 tied, CANL=12, CANH=13, GND2=15). NC pins 4, 6, 7, 14 are omitted from the symbol on purpose.\\n100 nF bypass on VCC1 and VCC2 matches the TI isolated-CAN reference (slla298). A bulk capacitor on VCC2 is OPEN.\\nU9 is Murata MEJ2S0505SC. Hipot 5.2 kVDC for 1 second. Murata says continuous barrier withstand is 2.4 kVDC and the part is functional isolation, not a safety barrier.\\n120 ohm preload is about 42 mA, just over 10 percent of the 400 mA rating, so the published tolerance envelope applies. 5 V plus 9 percent is 5.45 V, inside the ISO1042 4.5-5.5 V VCC2 range.\\nGND_CAN is not joined to REED_RET. C92, shield to GND_CAN, is 100 nF. Its working voltage must survive the barrier test and is a layout/part rating, not yet a placed voltage.\\nQ91 is DMP3099L, -30 V, -3.8 A. This circuit applies 5 V. Full-load primary current of the MEJ2S0505 is about 0.5 A.\\n33 ohm on TXD is a short series resistor for the logic edge. It is not a bus termination. No 120 ohm bus terminator is fitted." (at 20 90 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "15f46a1b-2eb5-4848-b802-b1bd879c66d6"))
  (embedded_fonts no)
)
